comments.message:
I think it would be a good test to be able to ensure the correct number of fan objects were created based on the JSON.  that would require a new public function

const std::vector<std::unique_ptr<Fan>>& Zone::getFans() const
{
  return _fans;
} 

It's always questionable if things should be exposed just for testing, but I think for this new code the benefits outweigh the cons.
